  "sticker": "sandpiper",
  "skeleton": "sandpiper side view facing right, mid-step: root between the feet; body with belly squash; head at the neck (the head-and-neck piece of the neck sheet, between the body and a copy of the body whose top fades in, so no chin line shows), face carrying the single eye and the long thin beak; near wing folded on the side (open in flight), the far wing shown only open in flight (shaded); both wing bones at the shoulder inside the body, below the head, with the open wings' roots there; legL (back) and legR (front) at the hip.",
